---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="After-School Program - Marietta Childcare"
  description="Discover Marietta Childcare's After-School Program with homework support, enrichment activities, and safe supervision for school-age children.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/hands_sorting_counting_bears_background.jpg" 
        alt="After-school activities" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">After-School Program</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Homework support, enrichment activities, and safe supervision for school-age children in a nurturing environment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's After-School Program serves school-age children with homework support, enrichment activities, and a safe environment. The After-School Program at Marietta Childcare provides care for children in kindergarten through elementary school during after-school hours.
        </p>

        <h2>Homework Support</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's After-School Program includes dedicated homework time with trained staff to support academic success. The After-School Program provides a quiet, organized space for children to complete assignments and develop study skills.
        </p>

        <h2>Enrichment Activities</h2>
        <p>
          The After-School Program at Marietta Childcare offers diverse enrichment activities including arts and crafts, STEM projects, sports, music, and outdoor play. Marietta Childcare's enrichment activities support skill development and foster interests in various areas.
        </p>

        <h2>Safe, Supervised Environment</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare provides a safe, secure environment for school-age children after school hours. The After-School Program maintains low staff-to-child ratios and implements security protocols to ensure child safety and wellbeing.
        </p>

        <h2>Snacks & Nutrition</h2>
        <p>
          The After-School Program at Marietta Childcare provides nutritious snacks to support children's energy and focus. Marietta Childcare offers healthy snack options that accommodate dietary preferences and allergies.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-primary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Program Features</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Homework support</li>
            <li>✓ Enrichment activities</li>
            <li>✓ Arts and crafts</li>
            <li>✓ STEM projects</li>
            <li>✓ Sports and games</li>
            <li>✓ Outdoor play</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-secondary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Age Range & Schedule</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Kindergarten through 5th grade</li>
            <li>✓ School-year programs</li>
            <li>✓ Flexible pickup times</li>
            <li>✓ Extended care available</li>
            <li>✓ Holiday programs</li>
            <li>✓ School break care</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/10 to-secondary/10 p-8 rounded-lg mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">After-School Care for Working Parents</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">Marietta Childcare's After-School Program provides peace of mind for working parents. The After-School Program offers reliable, quality care that supports academic success and personal development.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-primary text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          Schedule a Tour
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Related Programs & Resources</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <a href="/programs" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">All Programs →</a>
          <a href="/solutions/working-parents" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Solutions for Working Parents →</a>
          <a href="/faq/hours-and-schedule" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Hours and Schedule →</a>
          <a href="/resources/parenting-tips" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Parenting Tips →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
